  "<div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:flex-start\">\n    <canvas id=\"bigmap\" width=\"{0}\" height=\"{1}\" style=\"display:block;image-rendering:pixelated;cursor:grab;border:1px solid #000\"></canvas>\n    <div style=\"width:200px\"><h3>Обозначения</h3>{2}\n    <div style=\"margin-top:10px\" class=\"col\"><button data-act=\"mapHome\">К Анимансеру</button><div class=\"row\"><button data-act=\"mapZoom\" data-arg=\"1\">＋</button><button data-act=\"mapZoom\" data-arg=\"-1\">－</button></div></div>\n    <div class=\"dim\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Перетаскивайте карту мышью, колесо — масштаб. Подписи появляются у разведанных мест. Alt+ЛКМ — пинг (его видит друг).</div>\n    <div id=\"mapPlayers\">{3}</div></div></div>": "<div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:flex-start\">\n    <canvas id=\"bigmap\" width=\"{0}\" height=\"{1}\" style=\"display:block;image-rendering:pixelated;cursor:grab;border:1px solid #000\"></canvas>\n    <div style=\"width:200px\"><h3>Legend</h3>{2}\n    <div style=\"margin-top:10px\" class=\"col\"><button data-act=\"mapHome\">To the Animancer</button><div class=\"row\"><button data-act=\"mapZoom\" data-arg=\"1\">＋</button><button data-act=\"mapZoom\" data-arg=\"-1\">－</button></div></div>\n    <div class=\"dim\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drag the map with the mouse, wheel — zoom. Labels appear at explored places. Alt+left-click — a ping (your friend sees it).</div>\n    <div id=\"mapPlayers\">{3}</div></div></div>",
