  "\n  <h3>Ресурсы</h3>\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <button data-act=\"cheatGive\" data-arg=\"basic\">+500 базовых ресурсов</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatGive\" data-arg=\"all\">+50 всех предметов (без построек)</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatGive\" data-arg=\"blds\">+10 всех открытых построек</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatGive\" data-arg=\"gold\">+200 золота, мифрила, самоцветов</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatGive\" data-arg=\"ammo\">+200 болтов и камней</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatClear\">Очистить инвентарь</button>\n  </div>\n  <h3>Режимы</h3>\n  <div class=\"dim\">Бесплатная стройка: постройки ставятся, не тратясь из инвентаря (и при разборке не возвращаются). Крафт без ресурсов: любой рецепт крафтится, сырьё не нужно.</div>\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    {0}{1}{2}{3}{4}\n  </div>\n  <h3>Скорость времени</h3>\n  <div class=\"grid\">{5}\n    <button data-act=\"cheatSkip\" data-arg=\"600\">Пропустить 10 минут</button></div>\n  <h3>Исследования</h3>\n  <div class=\"grid\"><button data-act=\"cheatResearch\" data-arg=\"cur\">Завершить текущее</button><button data-act=\"cheatResearch\" data-arg=\"all\">Открыть все</button></div>\n  <h3>Мир и враги</h3>\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <button data-act=\"cheatMap\" data-arg=\"150\">Открыть карту (150)</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatMap\" data-arg=\"400\">Открыть карту (400)</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatTp\" data-arg=\"goblin\">К лагерю гоблинов</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatTp\" data-arg=\"orc\">К лагерю орков</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatTp\" data-arg=\"orc_big\">К крепости орков</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatTp\" data-arg=\"citadel\">К цитадели</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatTp\" data-arg=\"base\">Домой</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatRaid\" data-arg=\"weak\">Набег</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatRaid\" data-arg=\"strong\">Сильная орда</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatSiege\">Осада</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatElf\" data-arg=\"demand\">Дань эльфам сейчас</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatElf\" data-arg=\"punish\">Каратели эльфов</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatMerchant\">Торговец сейчас</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatKill\">Убить всех врагов рядом</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatWorker\" data-arg=\"orc\">+ орк-раб</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatWorker\" data-arg=\"human\">+ человек</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"dim\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Ё (или `) — открыть/закрыть это окно.</div>": "\n  <h3>Resources</h3>\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <button data-act=\"cheatGive\" data-arg=\"basic\">+500 basic resources</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatGive\" data-arg=\"all\">+50 of all items (no buildings)</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatGive\" data-arg=\"blds\">+10 of all unlocked buildings</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatGive\" data-arg=\"gold\">+200 gold, mithril, gems</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatGive\" data-arg=\"ammo\">+200 bolts and stones</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatClear\">Clear the inventory</button>\n  </div>\n  <h3>Modes</h3>\n  <div class=\"dim\">Free building: buildings are placed without being taken from the inventory (and aren't returned when dismantled). Crafting without resources: any recipe is crafted, no materials needed.</div>\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    {0}{1}{2}{3}{4}\n  </div>\n  <h3>Time speed</h3>\n  <div class=\"grid\">{5}\n    <button data-act=\"cheatSkip\" data-arg=\"600\">Skip 10 minutes</button></div>\n  <h3>Research</h3>\n  <div class=\"grid\"><button data-act=\"cheatResearch\" data-arg=\"cur\">Finish the current one</button><button data-act=\"cheatResearch\" data-arg=\"all\">Unlock all</button></div>\n  <h3>World and enemies</h3>\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <button data-act=\"cheatMap\" data-arg=\"150\">Reveal the map (150)</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatMap\" data-arg=\"400\">Reveal the map (400)</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatTp\" data-arg=\"goblin\">To a goblin camp</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatTp\" data-arg=\"orc\">To an orc camp</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatTp\" data-arg=\"orc_big\">To an orc fortress</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatTp\" data-arg=\"citadel\">To a citadel</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatTp\" data-arg=\"base\">Home</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatRaid\" data-arg=\"weak\">Raid</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatRaid\" data-arg=\"strong\">Strong horde</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatSiege\">Siege</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatElf\" data-arg=\"demand\">Elf tribute now</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatElf\" data-arg=\"punish\">Elf punishers</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatMerchant\">Merchant now</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatKill\">Kill all enemies nearby</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatWorker\" data-arg=\"orc\">+ orc slave</button>\n    <button data-act=\"cheatWorker\" data-arg=\"human\">+ human</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"dim\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">` (backquote) — open/close this window.</div>",
